{"seq":2,"slug":"cold-chain-temp-monitor","title":"全程温度监控与断链告警","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/special-goods-crossborder-logistics/cold-chain-temp-control/cold-chain-temp-monitor","wordCount":2066,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"全程温度监控与断链告警\">全程温度监控与断链告警</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>保温箱与冷媒决定的是&quot;理论上能维持多久&quot;，温度记录仪决定的是&quot;实际维持住了没有&quot;。这两件事缺一不可：没有标定的方案是赌博，没有记录的方案是无法追责的赌博。</p>\n<p>温度监控的技术载体是<strong>温度记录仪</strong>——一个按固定间隔采样、把温度与时间戳写入内部存储的小型设备。它通常被放在包件内部、尽量贴近制品的位置，因为箱内不同位置存在温度梯度，靠近冷媒的位置不能代表制品所处环境。采样完成后，记录仪导出一条时间序列，这条序列是判定温度是否超标的唯一原始依据。</p>\n<p>判定&quot;断链&quot;不是比较单点温度，而是<strong>在一个时间序列上做区间判定</strong>。需要三个参数同时定义：温度阈值（例如 2–8 ℃）、持续时长阈值（例如连续超过 30 分钟）、以及采样间隔（例如 5 分钟）。三者缺一不可，因为质量评估关心的是累积热暴露而不是瞬时峰值——一次因开箱造成的 2 分钟短时越界与持续 4 小时的越界，对制品的意义完全不同。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[记录仪导出时间序列] --&gt; B[按温区定义阈值]&#10;  B --&gt; C[扫描越界区间]&#10;  C --&gt; D{持续时长 ≥ 阈值?}&#10;  D --&gt;|否| E[记录为瞬时波动]&#10;  D --&gt;|是| F{越界方向}&#10;  F --&gt;|高温侧| G[热暴露累积判定]&#10;  F --&gt;|低温侧| H[冻伤判定]&#10;  G --&gt; I[分级: 轻微/严重/报废]&#10;  H --&gt; I&#10;  I --&gt; J[告警 + 触发处置流程]&#10;  E --&gt; K[归档]\">graph TD\n  A[记录仪导出时间序列] --&gt; B[按温区定义阈值]\n  B --&gt; C[扫描越界区间]\n  C --&gt; D{持续时长 ≥ 阈值?}\n  D --&gt;|否| E[记录为瞬时波动]\n  D --&gt;|是| F{越界方向}\n  F --&gt;|高温侧| G[热暴露累积判定]\n  F --&gt;|低温侧| H[冻伤判定]\n  G --&gt; I[分级: 轻微/严重/报废]\n  H --&gt; I\n  I --&gt; J[告警 + 触发处置流程]\n  E --&gt; K[归档]</pre><h2 id=\"三个参数的确定方式\">三个参数的确定方式</h2><p><strong>温度阈值</strong>直接来自温区定义。冷藏 2–8 ℃ 的方案，阈值就是 2 与 8；但实务中常把判定阈值设得略窄于标签范围（例如 3–7 ℃），给测量误差留余量。这是刻意的：如果判定阈值等于标签边界，那么所有在 1.9 ℃ 的读数都会被判为越界，即使实际制品温度仍在范围内。</p>\n<p><strong>持续时长阈值</strong>取决于制品的<strong>热惯性</strong>与法规要求。大体积液体制品的中心温度变化远慢于箱内空气温度，因此短暂的环境越界未必意味着制品越界。可以用<strong>平均动力学温度</strong>（MKT, Mean Kinetic Temperature）这个工具把温度波动折算成等效恒温：它用 Arrhenius 型的指数权重，把各温度按持续时间加权，得出一个&quot;等效热效应&quot;的恒定温度，其定义式基于样品温度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、各温度持续时长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、活化能 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 与气体常数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mean_kinetic_temperature\">Mean kinetic temperature</a>）。MKT 的价值在于让&quot;35 ℃ 持续 2 小时 + 5 ℃ 持续 22 小时&quot;与某个恒温值可比。</p>\n<h3 id=\"mkt-的计算形式\">MKT 的计算形式</h3><p>在采样间隔均匀的常见情形下，MKT 的计算可写成对温度的指数平均再取对数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>K</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>R</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{MKT} = \\frac{-\\Delta H / R}{\\ln\\left(\\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{i=1}^{n} e^{-\\Delta H / (R\\,T_i)}\\right)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.517em;vertical-align:-1.09em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.26em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.814em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.09em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为各采样点的绝对温度。这个式子的形状说明了它的关键性质：指数项对高温比对低温敏感得多，因此长时间的中度高温可能比短时峰值产生更大的等效热效应——这正好对应制品降解的物理机制。</p>\n<h3 id=\"采样间隔为什么决定判定能力\">采样间隔为什么决定判定能力</h3><p><strong>采样间隔</strong>是精度与记录容量的权衡。间隔太长会漏掉短时越界（这是最危险的错误——它让不合格的货物被判定为合格），太短会让记录仪存储溢出。5 分钟是常见的折中，但在空运跨洋线路（20+ 小时）上要确认记录仪容量足够。间隔还决定了越界时长的测量分辨率——如果采样间隔是 30 分钟，&quot;持续 30 分钟&quot;这个阈值实际上无法准确判定。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>典型取值</th>\n<th>设置过松的后果</th>\n<th>设置过严的后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>温度阈值</td>\n<td>标签范围收窄 1 ℃</td>\n<td>漏判真实越界</td>\n<td>大量误报</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>持续时长</td>\n<td>30 分钟</td>\n<td>把真实断链判为波动</td>\n<td>频繁误告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>采样间隔</td>\n<td>5 分钟</td>\n<td>漏掉短时越界</td>\n<td>存储溢出、成本上升</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"断链的分级与处置\">断链的分级与处置</h2><p>不是所有越界都要报废。合理的做法是把断链分成三级，每一级对应不同的处置动作：</p>\n<p><strong>观察级</strong>：越界幅度小且时长短（例如 8.5 ℃ 持续 20 分钟），记录归档，正常放行，同时在制品批次上留痕。</p>\n<p><strong>评估级</strong>：越界幅度或时长超过观察阈值但未达报废标准（例如 12 ℃ 持续 2 小时）。此时不应自动放行，需要质量或产品方依据该制品的稳定性数据判定。稳定性数据的来源是制品的稳定性研究——<a href=\"perishable-shelf-sla\">生鲜时效与保质期 SLA</a> 里讨论的剩余货架期与这里的判定共用同一组数据。</p>\n<p><strong>报废级</strong>：越界严重（例如冷冻品经历解冻后重新冻结的循环）或累计热暴露超过稳定性上限。直接拦截，不进入销售链路。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分级阈值应当可配置且可追溯\">分级阈值应当可配置且可追溯</h3><p>分级阈值依赖制品的稳定性数据，不同品类差别很大（疫苗与巧克力的容忍度完全不同）。因此阈值不能硬编码，而要作为<strong>制品属性的一个字段</strong>挂在温区方案上。同时每一次判定都要记录使用的阈值版本——因为阈值可能随稳定性研究更新而调整，事后追溯必须知道当时用的是哪一版。</p>\n<h3 id=\"记录仪的校准与失效模式\">记录仪的校准与失效模式</h3><p>温度记录仪本身会漂移，因此需要校准，并保留校准证书。这带来两个工程要求：一是记录仪实体要有 <code>last_calibrated_at</code> 与证书引用；二是要能识别<strong>记录仪失效</strong>与<strong>真实断链</strong>的差别——一台完全无数据的记录仪不是&quot;温度合格&quot;，而是&quot;无法证明温度合格&quot;，这两种状态在合规上是不同的，必须用独立的状态值区分，不能默认为合格。</p>\n<h2 id=\"事件模型与告警的落地\">事件模型与告警的落地</h2><p>温度曲线最终要以事件的形式进入履约系统。每一次越界判定产出一个事件，携带判定所用的全部参数。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE temp_excursion (&#10;  excursion_id   TEXT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  package_id     TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  logger_id      TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  zone_code      TEXT NOT NULL,          -- 如 2-8C&#10;  direction      TEXT NOT NULL,          -- high | low&#10;  started_at     TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  ended_at       TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  duration_min   INTEGER NOT NULL,&#10;  peak_value_c   NUMERIC NOT NULL,&#10;  mkt_c          NUMERIC,                -- 该区间的等效恒温&#10;  grade          TEXT NOT NULL,          -- observed | assessed | scrapped&#10;  threshold_ver  TEXT NOT NULL,          -- 判定所用阈值版本&#10;  logger_state   TEXT NOT NULL,          -- ok | no_data | drifted&#10;  CHECK (direction IN (&#39;high&#39;,&#39;low&#39;)),&#10;  CHECK (grade IN (&#39;observed&#39;,&#39;assessed&#39;,&#39;scrapped&#39;))&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_excursion_pkg ON temp_excursion (package_id, started_at DESC);&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_excursion_grade_open ON temp_excursion (grade)&#10;  WHERE grade = &#39;assessed&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> temp_excursion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  excursion_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  package_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  logger_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  zone_code      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 如 2-8C</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  direction      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- high | low</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  started_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ended_at       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  duration_min   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  peak_value_c   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  mkt_c          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 该区间的等效恒温</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  grade          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- observed | assessed | scrapped</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  threshold_ver  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 判定所用阈值版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  logger_state   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- ok | no_data | drifted</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (direction </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'high'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'low'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (grade </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'observed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'assessed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'scrapped'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_excursion_pkg</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> temp_excursion (package_id, started_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_excursion_grade_open</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> temp_excursion (grade)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> grade </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'assessed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这段结构里有三个刻意的设计。<code>mkt_c</code> 与 <code>peak_value_c</code> 并存，因为峰值高但 MKT 低（短时尖峰）与峰值不高但 MKT 高（长时间轻度越界）是两种不同的风险形态。<code>threshold_ver</code> 记录判定时用的阈值版本，使事后审计可复现。<code>logger_state</code> 把&quot;记录仪失效&quot;与&quot;真实越界&quot;分开，避免无数据被误判为合格——这是温度监控里最隐蔽的一类错误。</p>\n<p>告警策略上，<code>grade = &#39;assessed&#39;</code> 的部分索引服务于一个具体场景：需要人工评估的断链是一个<strong>必须被清零的待办队列</strong>——它们既不能自动放行，也不能自动报废，如果没有人跟进就会静默堆积。而 <code>observed</code> 与 <code>scrapped</code> 都不需要人工介入，前者放行归档，后者直接拦截。</p>\n<p>温度事件最终会汇入承运商轨迹事件流（见 106 号 hub 的事件标准化），因此事件的编码应当与那套体系对齐，避免维护两套时间语义。断链造成的成本（报废、赔付、返工）在 <a href=\"../special-customs-ops/special-channel-cost-risk\">特货渠道成本与风险监控</a> 里汇总。方案本身的标定方法见 <a href=\"temp-zone-packaging-coolant\">温区/保温箱/冷媒方案</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>标定回答&quot;理论上能撑多久&quot;，记录回答&quot;实际撑住了没有&quot;；两者缺一不可。</li>\n<li>断链判定需要温度阈值、持续时长阈值、采样间隔三个参数同时定义，缺一会产生漏判或误报。</li>\n<li>采样间隔决定了时长阈值的可判定精度；间隔过长会让短时越界不可见。</li>\n<li>MKT 把温度波动折算为等效恒温，适合用累积热暴露而非瞬时峰值做判定。</li>\n<li>断链分三级（观察 / 评估 / 报废），阈值应作为制品属性可配置，并记录判定所用的阈值版本。</li>\n<li>&quot;记录仪失效&quot;必须与&quot;真实越界&quot;用独立状态区分，无数据不等于合格。</li>\n<li>需要人工评估的断链应当是一个显式的待办队列，用部分索引保证它不会被静默堆积。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"全程温度监控与断链告警","id":"全程温度监控与断链告警"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"三个参数的确定方式","id":"三个参数的确定方式"},{"level":3,"text":"MKT 的计算形式","id":"mkt-的计算形式"},{"level":3,"text":"采样间隔为什么决定判定能力","id":"采样间隔为什么决定判定能力"},{"level":2,"text":"断链的分级与处置","id":"断链的分级与处置"},{"level":3,"text":"分级阈值应当可配置且可追溯","id":"分级阈值应当可配置且可追溯"},{"level":3,"text":"记录仪的校准与失效模式","id":"记录仪的校准与失效模式"},{"level":2,"text":"事件模型与告警的落地","id":"事件模型与告警的落地"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"温区/保温箱/冷媒方案","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/special-goods-crossborder-logistics/cold-chain-temp-control/temp-zone-packaging-coolant"},"next":{"title":"生鲜时效与保质期 SLA","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/special-goods-crossborder-logistics/cold-chain-temp-control/perishable-shelf-sla"}}